# Per-configuration cocotb results. tests/.gitignore ignores `sim_build_*/` for
# every bench but names result files ONE AT A TIME (results.xml,
# results_fake.xml, results_readpath.xml), and this bench writes five
# (results_<cfg>.xml, one per elaboration). Ignored here rather than by widening
# the shared file: the same local-.gitignore precedent as
# tests/mdio_phy_model/.gitignore, and it keeps a five-lane wave out of one
# shared file for a housekeeping line.
results_*.xml
